            </note>
            <note corresp="#d325-f2" n="2" xml:id="d325-f2-content">
                <p>August 4, 1949.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d325-f3" n="3" xml:id="d325-f3-content">
                <p>A handwritten notation on the Secretary of State’s copy indicates that the
                    document was approved on August 5.</p>
            </note>
